#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3066
msgid "Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. While automatic installs are on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync."
msgstr "Razpoložljive prevode lahko namestite z enim klikom, manjkajoče pa lahko zahtevate. Ko so samodejne namestitve vklopljene, se prevodi, ki jih storitev navaja kot razpoložljive za jezike, ki jih upravljate, namestijo med sinhronizacijo dvakrat na dan."

#. translators: %s: the date an available translation was built.
#: admin/class-babilim-cell.php:326
#, php-format
msgid "Available · %s"
msgstr "Na voljo · %s"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:402
msgid "Babilim Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve Babilim"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4677
msgid "Babilim adds translations for every language checked here."
msgstr "Babilim doda prevode za vse tukaj izbrane jezike."

#: includes/class-babilim-packager.php:110
msgid "Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site's public directory), or ask your host for one."
msgstr "Babilim ni mogel potrditi začasne mape zunaj spletnega mesta, zato komponenta ni bila zapakirana in ni bilo naloženo nič. Določite BABILIM_TEMP_DIR v wp-config.php kot zapisljivo mapo zunaj korenskega imenika spletnega mesta (na primer mapo poleg javnega imenika vašega spletišča, ne v njem) ali jo zahtevajte pri ponudniku gostovanja."

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:987
msgid "Babilim could not finish checking this site."
msgstr "Babilim ni mogel dokončati preverjanja tega spletišča."

#. translators: 1: short name of the step that failed, 2: the message for that failure.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2381
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s"
msgstr "Babilim ni mogel dokončati omogočanja (%1$s): %2$s"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3792
msgid "Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused."
msgstr "Babilim ni mogel dokončati preverjanja tega spletišča (storitev ga ni mogla doseči nazaj). Registracija je začasno ustavljena."

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:434
#: includes/class-babilim-sync-installer.php:401
msgid "Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds."
msgstr "Babilim tega spletišča ni mogel preveriti, zato se ne bo nič prenesalo ali namestilo, dokler preverjanje ne uspe."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2216
msgid "Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed."
msgstr "Babilim ni mogel preveriti tega spletišča, zato se nič ne prenese ali namesti."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3053
msgid "Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each."
msgstr "Babilim poišče vtičnike in teme na tem spletišču, ki nimajo prevoda za vaš jezik, in za vsakega namesti prevod."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:984
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1355
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1433
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2335
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2665
#: includes/class-babilim-api-client.php:532
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:311
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:362
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:705
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:838
msgid "Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet."
msgstr "Babilim za to spletišče še ni omogočen."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4239
msgid "Babilim has not installed any translation for this language."
msgstr "Babilim ni namestil nobenega prevoda za ta jezik."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2517
msgid "Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?"
msgstr "Pri Babilim je prišlo do napake. Želite deliti poročilo o napaki?"

#. translators: %d: how many translations were installed automatically.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3122
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit."
msgid_plural "Babilim installed %d translations automatically since your last visit."
msgstr[0] "Babilim je od vašega zadnjega obiska samodejno namestil %d prevod."
msgstr[1] "Babilim je od vašega zadnjega obiska samodejno namestil %d prevoda."
msgstr[2] "Babilim je od vašega zadnjega obiska samodejno namestil %d prevode."
msgstr[3] "Babilim je od vašega zadnjega obiska samodejno namestil %d prevodov."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2492
msgid "Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working."
msgstr "Babilim je onemogočen. Nič več se ne pošilja; že nameščeni prevodi še naprej delujejo."

#. translators: %d: number of components found on this site.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2407
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found."
msgid_plural "Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d components were found."
msgstr[0] "Babilim je omogočen: to spletišče je preverjeno in najdena je %d komponenta."
msgstr[1] "Babilim je omogočen: to spletišče je preverjeno in najdeni sta %d komponenti."
msgstr[2] "Babilim je omogočen: to spletišče je preverjeno in najdene so %d komponente."
msgstr[3] "Babilim je omogočen: to spletišče je preverjeno in najdenih je %d komponent."

#. translators: %s: when the last attempt happened.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3148
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)"
msgstr "Babilim omogoča in preverja to spletišče … (zadnji poskus: %s)"

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:2376
msgid "Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish."
msgstr "Babilim omogoča in preverja to spletišče … Znova naložite stran ali počakajte, da se načrtovano preverjanje konča."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:4426
msgid "Babilim is not enabled."
msgstr "Babilim ni omogočen."

#. translators: %s: Babilim support email address. Do not translate or change it.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1949
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim is set to erase this site's identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick \"Delete all Babilim data on uninstall\" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?"
msgstr "Babilim je nastavljen tako, da ob izbrisu vtičnika izbriše identiteto tega spletišča. Plačljive licence, vezane na to spletišče, potem ni mogoče samodejno obnoviti; obrniti se morate na podporo Babilim na %s. Če želite ohraniti identiteto, pritisnite Prekliči, v nastavitvah Babilim odstranite kljukico pri možnosti »Ob odstranitvi izbriši vse podatke Babilim« in znova deaktivirajte. Vseeno deaktiviram?"

#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:348
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:939
#: includes/class-babilim-site.php:1271
msgid "Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check."
msgstr "Babilimu je za ta korak zmanjkalo časa, zato bo nadaljeval pri naslednjem preverjanju."

#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3827
msgid "Babilim settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve Babilim"

#. translators: %s: the date and time syncing is expected to resume.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:1622
#, php-format
msgid "Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s."
msgstr "Storitev je sinhronizacijo Babilim začasno zakasnila (omejitev hitrosti); ponovno bo poskusila po %s."

#: includes/class-babilim-upload.php:191
msgid "Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again."
msgstr "Babilim je bil posodobljen, medtem ko je to nalaganje čakalo. Stari paket je bil zavržen; prosimo, ponovno potrdite nalaganje."

#. translators: 1: plugin or theme name, 2: its version number.
#: admin/class-babilim-admin.php:3428
